From 814554d1bf781c41f19fac4edfcff3f298d924c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
Date: Thu, 17 Sep 2026 09:19:52 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add gfx90a and gfx1100 Triton defaults

- Add validated gfx942 defaults for gfx90a.
- Add safe defaults for gfx1100.
- Enable corrected gfx1100 MLA defaults.
- Use a smaller A16W8 tile to fit LDS.
- Cover 33 shared families on both GPUs.

Tools used:
- GPT: 5.6 Sol

Signed-off-by: Mika Laitio <mika.laitio@amd.com>
